&lt;p&gt;  &lt;strong&gt;  C. Nationally Non-Covered Indications&lt;&sol;strong&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;  Effective for services performed on and after March 20, 2007, the Centers for Medicare &amp;amp; Medicaid Services determines that the use of osmotic BBBD is not reasonable and necessary when it is used as part of a treatment regimen for brain tumors.&lt;&sol;p&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;  D. Other&lt;&sol;strong&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;  This NCD does not alter in any manner the coverage of anti-cancer chemotherapy.&lt;&sol;p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;  (This NCD last reviewed March 2007.)&lt;&sol;p&gt;
